# FSD architecture

Layers (top → bottom): `app` → `widgets` → `features` → `entities` → `shared`.

- Import only from layers **below**. Never upward (e.g. `shared` must not import `features`).
- Slices on the same layer must not import each other.
- `src/app` = routing only (layouts, pages, route groups). Real UI/logic lives in lower layers.
- New UI: pick the lowest layer that fits (entity UI vs widget composition vs feature interaction).

```ts
// ❌ BAD — entity imports a widget
import { DefaultLayout } from '@/widgets/DefaultLayout';

// ✅ GOOD — app/widget composes entities
import { HeaderMenu } from '@/entities/menu/ui/HeaderMenu';
```
